# Guide

## Differences from the spreadsheet

- The fieldtime setting is a weight instead of a percentage, eg 1:1:1:1 means everyone has 25% fieldtime, 3:1:1:1 means the first character has half fieldtime and the rest share the other half and so on. Directly using percentages will still work
- Fischl's burst doesn't automatically add a use.


